{{Term/Store|Courser Bee Honey|Courser Bee Honeys|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Courser Bee Honey}}
In {{BotW}}, Courser Bee Honey resembles beehives and can be found on various [[Tree]]s throughout [[Hyrule Kingdom]]. It can be found in various [[Region]]s, but it appears more commonly in [[Necluda]]. Each hive is guarded by a swarm of [[Courser Bee]]s that will do a quarter [[Heart]] of damage and take two hits to scare off. Their Honey can be eaten to restore two [[Heart]]s. When [[Cooking|Cooked]], they provide [[Link]] with [[Meal]]s that grant him [[Stamina Restoration]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Courser Bee Honeys can also be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to make [[Orange Dye]].

The [[Side Quest]] "[[Koko's Specialty]]" requires [[Link]] to retrieve Courser Bee Honey for [[Koko]] so she can make a [[Honeyed Apple]].<ref name="BotW Koko"/> After Link delivers the Courser Bee Honey and Koko makes her desert, she will thank Link and give him an Energizing Honeyed Apple.<ref name="BotW Koko 2"/>

