==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
Courser Bee Honeys can be bought for 24 [[Rupee]]s at the [[Mabe Ranch Co-op]] from [[Makimi]]. Unlike many other [[Material]]s, they are not Battle-Specific Materials of any [[Scenario]]s or [[Challenge]]s. They are needed for [[Cooking]] [[Glazed Mushrooms]], [[Honey Candy|Honey Candies]], [[Honey Crepe]]s, and [[Honeyed Fruits]]. They can also be sold at most locations for 10 [[Rupee]]s and specifically to [[Bena]] for 25 Rupees.
{{Noncanon|End}}

